{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Roy arrives, and takes a gander at the rubble. Mess. Only slightly sifted through like someone was trying to get something out. Maybe the owner, the coinage that was in there.\nHe shrugs, sticks his wrench staff in a small pile of kinda stuck together rubble, and ties the cloak he took off to the staff.\n\nAnd he starts moving the rubble.\n\nJust getting it piece by piece, out of the ruin, onto some pile next to it. Isn't going to get much done today, but gotta start somewhere.","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:28:08.563000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865570499333062677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Grimlock sees you do this and ambles over. She thinks it's a nice game of sort-of fetch, and helps you organize the piles.","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:30:15.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865571030496313345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"It is before dawn. The street sweepers, the lamp snuffers the people who walked these streets in the time between times. They are not alone today. Countless homeless sit on the street, covered in dirt and blood. Shock written on all of their faces. But seeing Roy begin to clear the first stones has an effect. Those closest to him, while still dissociated from everything else, found them selves gravitating toward the work. The hope and forward momentum of doing something. The ties that bind a people together in times of tragedy and grief. The bonds that come of sifting through what was in order to make new.","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:33:55.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865571955645874226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"One becomes two. Two becomes Five. Five becomes Ten. And work becomes the thing that that puts the tragedy aside. In a city filled with smoke and rubble before the rage beings, first there is the bond of the broken. The hand grasping hand and tools, and bread.","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:35:52.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865572445783457832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"During the time numbers aren't growing that much yet, Roy gives away all 10 of his goodberries on hand to the homeless who joined him.","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:39:32.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865573366614327346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"The mender walks up with sacks of good berries and hands them to a random person that looks like they don't know how to help \"give these out to the people needing hope..... if you run out.... I'll make more\"\n\nhe then turns to <@!148682928434577408> and works alongside him \"when we are done here... meet me in my cottage for now, I will help you and focus on the task at hand\" and with that he moves off to another pile and begins silently clearing rubble","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:51:05.802000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865576275892109312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Grimlock takes the role of beast of burden. She's carried dead in her time, but the corpse of a city must be one of the heaviest.","created_at":"2021-07-16T12:52:26.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865576613987221534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Roy sits down after some time with a few more people chatting after doing some more work, thanks everyone for the help, and decides to go back to wandering for a bit, after reassuring everyone he'll be back next night to continue. He also leaves (number of homeless who joined him) silver coins from Bo's pouch for the hungry, one for each of the homeless who helped him, for a warm meal.\nHe gathers his wrench and cloak, and after tying the latter around his waist wanders off towards the port.\n\n(Bo left Roy a pouch with 5gp34sp that I left in other possessions on the charsheet. I guess roll or declare how many people there were and I'll subtract that, otherwise if busy I'll just do something like 20)","created_at":"2021-07-16T16:58:05.899000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865638435883581492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Kukudh flies past on the way to <#852737863170654259>. `Hey, guess this is a good place.`\nas a pigeon, they swoop down and drop the remaining soon-to-expire bugberries. `Delivery for you!` before continuing on their flight.","created_at":"2021-07-16T18:38:27.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865663693195182090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Paeton ventures over to the rubble of the money-changer. It looks like people have made a bit of progress on its rebuild. Paeton will spend   the next 4 hours, helping to rebuild/clean up, as much as he can. He feels as if he's   done this kind of thing before, but he has no memory of it. His hands seems to, but as soon as he starts to think about it too much, they lose their expertise.","created_at":"2021-07-16T20:09:19.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865686559202213888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"Seeing the homeless, all around him, he offers what little he can. He walks up to the first person he can see, and offers to clean them up with prestidigitation. Anyone else who asks, he will provide the same service to.","created_at":"2021-07-16T20:10:33.210000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865686868816429117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"858149843871727656","content":"If he sees any homeless children, or young adults, he offers to buy them food and drink. (He will need to run back to his airship to get his coinage).","created_at":"2021-07-16T20:11:39.687000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865687147641045012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
